idence_ids":["mapping.long.prop-collapse"],"id":"long.prop-collapse","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Proposition 2.5 (A cofinal carry bound)","locator":"Long record Proposition 2.5, p. 28, label prop:collapse","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Let $A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}$ with $1 \\notin A$. If $|\\operatorname{ihc}(A,N)|\\le C\\sqrt{N+1}+C'$ for arbitrarily large $N$, with fixed constants $C,C'$, then $\\delta=0$. For the particular greedy support $A=G$ of $1/2$, a one-sided upper bound $\\operatorname{ihc}(G,N)\\le C\\sqrt{N+1}+C'$ already suffices.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.prop-collapse","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.prop-collapse","id":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.prop-collapse%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.greedy_half_of_cofinal_upper_carry%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.prop-collapse%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.greedy_half_of_cofinal_upper_carry%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.greedy_half_of_cofinal_upper_carry"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.prop-collapse","id":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.prop-collapse%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.half_of_cofinal_absolute_carry%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345